Subject:        Onyx, a C++ toolpackage for database applications
Archived-By:    ftp.ccc.de (193.16.3.1) and bakunin.north.de (00 49 0421 1497)
Status:         Runs fine under Linux and SunOs
Needs:          GNU CC++ Version 2.3.3
